WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.980
White Cats Dormitory
White Cats House

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:13.590
One more week until Per's birthday!

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.990
I wonder what kind of present I should get her.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.970
-The shower's all yours.
-Okay!

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:24.500
You're in high spirits.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.890
I was just thinking about
how spectacular your birthday party is going to be!

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.510
What? I don't need one.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:39.390
Actually, I have a favor to ask you for that day

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:41.520
Anything for you!

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.610
You see...

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.440
Well...

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:30.840
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:39.690
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:45.690
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:51.030
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:56.200
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:59.960
So that I can protect you

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:05.460
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:11.010
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:16.060
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:23.020
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:33.130
Romio and Char and the Present

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:35.390
Just one more week until her birthday!
Romio and Char and the Present

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:38.050
How should I go about acquiring a present?
Romio and Char and the Present

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:40.860
If I just had a way to get outside.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.360
Whose birthday?

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:43.560
Oh, Per--

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:45.120
Pearl Jam!

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.060
What are you doing? You stabbed me!

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.560
I told you not to just walk into my room!

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:52.870
Where's the other one?

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.410
Teria?

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:57.370
She's been under the bed since last night.

00:02:57.370 --> 00:02:59.130
Good morning, big sis.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:04.800
When Teria takes interest in someone,
she follows them around.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:07.450
But she's Teria, so she hides.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:08.580
So she's a stalker?

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:13.020
I have to be more careful.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:15.590
Now, let's go to Dahlia Street.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:18.440
You're going to Dahlia Street?

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:22.820
It's an errand.
Even prefects can't do their jobs empty-handed.

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:25.350
We're just so busy I'd rather not go.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:27.600
This is it!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.360
Outing Permission Slip

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:42.340
How lucky for me to relieve them of shopping duty.

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:44.120
Time to search for a present!

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.310
Maybe easier said than done.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:58.130
What would Persia even like?

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:07.140
-I'm sure this would make Persia happy!
-I'm sure this would make Persia happy!

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:10.070
-Char!
-Why are you here, Inuzuka?

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:11.990
I could ask you the same thing!

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:14.620
Let go. I grabbed it first.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:17.900
What? I was the one who saw it first.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.120
-You're going to rip it!
-You're going to rip it!

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.530
You'd better pay for that!

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:24.530
Damn, you're the worst.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:27.510
That's my line.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:30.410
You're an eyesore, won't you get out of my sight?

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:34.310
You seem even more upset than usual.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:38.920
Well, of course, because I hate you.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.770
That's reassuring!

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.520
Because I despise you too!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:45.430
Hey, you two, no fighting.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:48.680
Oh, Princess Char.

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:51.430
What are you doing here? What about school?

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:53.620
It's all right.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:56.410
The professors gave me permission to leave.

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:57.560
She's in cat-mode.

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:01.540
There are radical Touwa elements
hiding on this island right now.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:03.290
Please return to school.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:05.070
Don't worry about me.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:07.990
Without an escort, I simply cannot allow it.

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:08.450
I need to get out of this situation. But...

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:11.680
Pride
Present
I need to get out of this situation. But...

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:12.200
Present
Pride

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:12.250
Pride
Present

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:12.290
Pride
Present

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:12.330
Present

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.370
But I do have an escort!

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.720
A super strong escort from the West!

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:20.040
What? Where is--

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.440
Hey, let go.

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.400
Just play along.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:28.320
Hey! Leave my clothes--

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:31.060
No! Stop, please!

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.950
This person is my escort.

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:39.110
When did I--?

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.370
-That's just that student--
-What student?

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:46.360
What ever do you mean?

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:51.550
Why do I have to be your escort?
This disguise won't fool anyone.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:53.380
You think I'm enjoying this?

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:56.430
You were my only choice, I had to.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:06:01.400
Like I care. I have no intention of tagging along with you.

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:04.400
If you have a favor to ask, you'd better bow.

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:05.820
Wait!

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:15.230
Didn't you come here to buy a birthday present for Per?

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.070
Well, I know...

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:19.980
what Per really wants.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.980
What Persia really wants?

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.710
I'd gladly share that info with my escort.

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:28.990
I want to know!

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:32.760
No! Something like this has more meaning
if I pick it myself.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.490
She’ll be happy with whatever I get!

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.300
Are you sure?

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:39.220
Her first present from her lover.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:42.310
Her expectations must be sky-high.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.610
Imagine giving her something subpar.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:47.900
Here you go! A Mr. Specs and Pecs figure!

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:50.010
Wow, thanks...

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:54.510
That would spell the end of your relationship.

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:57.520
No!

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:02.120
Could you not cling to me so much?

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:04.290
I wouldn't cling to you if you asked me to.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:09.060
I'll tell you now, if you suggest something weird
I'll stop escorting you.

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:11.280
-Such nice weather.
-You listening?

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.780
Here's our first stop.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:25.730
No, no, no. I can't do this.
It's so embarrassing!

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:26.890
Are you a child?

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:29.730
Can't you look for your own underwear later?

00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:30.930
I couldn't care less.

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:33.110
How rude.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:35.430
My bosom is in perfect order.

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:39.910
This is a present for Per, of course!

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:42.690
Black would look nice on my baby doll.

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:46.960
Persia's underwear?

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:50.200
I'm not just a kid anymore, you know?

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:53.500
Hey! That's basically just strings! Forget it!

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.830
Don't start imagining weird things. Creep.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.990
Go with these so she doesn't get cold.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:00.720
Even if the wind blows up her skirt, there's no worries!

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:02.450
How lame!

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.060
No, come to think of it, it works.

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:06.960
So warm!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.020
But I just can't give up on this thong!

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:12.840
You fool! Fluffy lace is obviously the way to go!

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:15.280
I just got the chills.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:16.490
Is it a cold?

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:19.600
I'm your nurse, 24/7, 365!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:20.820
How about this?

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:23.120
That’s perfect! White is definitely her color.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:26.870
I'll say! You've got an eye for this.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.500
It's not like I asked for your opinion.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:32.280
But you are the one who's asking.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:34.550
Don't speak to me.

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:35.960
Sure, sure.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.630
Jeez, what's her problem?

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:42.390
Of course it's gotta be white and lacey.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.540
I just can't decide.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:50.230
Are we going to wander around all damn day?

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:54.050
I bet you don't even know what Persia wants.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:59.060
You’re one to talk.
How can her lover not know what she likes?

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:03.410
Can you really even say you love her?

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.330
I can't help it!

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:08.120
Persia doesn't talk much about herself.

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:11.330
Then how can you really call yourselves lovers?

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:13.130
Break up with her, yeah!

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:15.320
-Break up with her, yeah!
-You, shut up!

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:17.320
Break up with her!

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.710
It's a squall!

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:22.080
That's cold!

00:09:24.430 --> 00:09:27.350
We were right to send him on our errand.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:30.770
But I wonder what business he had at Dahlia Street.

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:33.440
-Shopping?
-Who knows?

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.590
I am a little curious.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:40.280
Speaking of curious, what about that rosary?

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:42.030
He's not a White Cat.

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:43.860
Why did he have that?

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:45.410
What's all this about?

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.020
We'll have to wait until it stops.

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:14.840
This is the worst.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:17.840
Nothing ever goes right with you.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:19.570
Shut it.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.220
Give me that.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.950
You're not wringing hard enough.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.100
I can hear the seams tearing!

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:28.850
-Here.
-It's in tatters, you dunce!

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:30.450
You'll be punished for this!

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:32.580
Whatever, just wear it.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.730
If you don't, well...

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:37.240
there'll be all sorts of trouble.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:44.930
What is it?

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:46.840
Is it arousing you?

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.470
Want to touch?

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:51.890
Yeah, right. And you're too close.

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:56.150
Come on, why don't you give up on Per.

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:58.510
In exchange,

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:01.650
I'll do all the things...

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:04.010
you've wanted to do.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:10.270
How would you react if I said that?

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:14.410
-What are you--?
-Even if you're joking,

00:11:14.410 --> 00:11:17.780
you shouldn't say that to someone
who doesn't want to hear it.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:25.260
That's payback.

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:30.540
It seems the rain has stopped.

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:36.270
I was going to tell Per
if you had some kind of ulterior motive.

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:39.050
But I guess there's no chance of that.

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:43.150
You're relieved of escort duty.

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:46.660
I'll come search with Scott some other day.

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:50.040
Sorry for dragging you along.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.390
-Wait up!
-No!

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:13.430
Give it back, brother!

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:15.080
No way!

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:17.460
Hey, stop that!

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:20.720
-Mama!
-Give it back.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:25.550
It's been so long since I've been told off like that.

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:32.410
Back then, no matter how greedy my request,
no one would scold me.

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:36.750
Everyone wanted to fulfill my every whim.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:40.290
Because of that, I was too selfish at home,

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:44.070
and got the nickname "Tyrant Princess."

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.320
-Bad!
-But...

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:49.510
You can't be so selfish.

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.830
Everyone will hate you.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:54.740
Persia, what are you saying?

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:57.340
-Apologize.
-But...

00:12:57.610 --> 00:13:01.540
You have to tell someone
when they do something wrong...

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:03.980
if they're your friend.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:06.940
You're an attendant.

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:08.740
You’re not considered a friend.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.620
No, I don't mind.

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:12.850
Miss Char?

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:19.370
It's okay, Per is my friend!

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:27.880
Per was angry, but she was trying to help.

00:13:29.510 --> 00:13:32.870
I never thought he would get angry with me, too.

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:42.380
Princess Char, right?

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:44.880
Who is it?

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.260
-Don't move.
-Radicals!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:56.390
Who would've guessed I'd meet
the accursed Princess of the West in a place like this?

00:13:56.670 --> 00:14:00.290
Dahlia Street belongs to Touwa.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:03.280
We've got to thin out you outsiders.

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:05.590
Keep quiet and--

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:11.510
My goodness.

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:14.510
Trying to lay your dirty paws on me...

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:16.560
What a couple of bad boys.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.250
It's time for your punishment.

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:21.880
What's going on?

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:25.520
Oh, hey, bro. You look tough.

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:28.700
Why don't you let loose on this invader too?

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:32.140
This is a chance to give this brat what she deserves.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.450
Lend a hand, would you?

00:14:36.110 --> 00:14:38.330
That sounds fun.

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:40.520
I hate this girl, too.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:44.280
Right? As a fellow Touwan--

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:47.710
But today I'm not Touwan.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:51.530
I'm Princess Char's escort.

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:56.160
Better luck next time.

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:01.850
Why did you save me?

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:05.480
Don't you hate me?

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:09.610
Don't think I'm indebted to you, I wasn't in a pinch.

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:12.680
Or did you think I'd lose on my own?

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.240
What's with you?

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:18.810
Don't get confused. It wasn't for you.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:24.540
If something happened to you, Persia would be sad.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.820
I don't want to see her make that face.

00:15:28.080 --> 00:15:30.570
It was for Per?

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:33.070
Is there a problem?

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:41.530
What the heck?

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:45.770
How much do you love Per?

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:47.890
This man...

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:49.340
is an idiot.

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:52.520
An even bigger idiot...

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:53.730
than I am.

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:54.900
Give me a break!

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:05.610
I was jealous of you.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:08.930
She asked if I would lie to the housemaster...

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:15.220
because she wanted to spend her birthday with you.

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:20.300
That stickler for the rules
actually wants to break the dorm's curfew.

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:24.060
That was unthinkable for her before now.

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:29.010
You're so transparent.

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:38.510
I was happy just being by her side as her friend.

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:41.270
But...

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:44.910
Seeing her being drawn closer and closer to you,

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:50.150
I started thinking
there must be a face that she shows only to you.

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.090
It was...

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:56.670
unbearably frustrating.

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:10.300
Don't try to console me in your weird way.

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:16.490
You're as awkward as they come.

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:22.110
You'll just have to think of a present on your own.

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:25.450
One that would make Per the happiest.

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:31.580
A reward for being my escort today.

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:33.670
Use with care.

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:52.210
How am I supposed to "use" this?

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:57.970
I'm super late thanks to Char.

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:01.600
That was close!

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:06.350
An arrow message? From Persia?

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:13.230
I'll be waiting in the library. From Persia.

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:15.860
What's this about?

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:20.620
So, Inuzuka...

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:23.090
I have a request.

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:32.630
Would you celebrate my birthday with me?

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:35.880
Persia did the inviting!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:39.940
Oh, I see. Your birthday. I'd forgotten.

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:42.360
Yeah, I guess I can spend it with you.

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:43.900
Until death do us part.

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:45.390
I didn't ask for all that.

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:49.250
-A sigh?
-No!

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:52.450
I was worried you'd turn me down.

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:54.280
So, I'm relieved...

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.530
I wanna hold her!

00:18:56.810 --> 00:19:02.780
So this year,
don't walk into the White Cats house like you always do.

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:08.540
-Every year, you crash the party my dorm throws for me.
-Happy birthday, Lady Persia.

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:11.430
We're here to celebrate!

00:19:11.430 --> 00:19:13.550
Here's your present, it's hell!

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:15.920
Happy birthday!

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:20.570
It becomes a brawl and the place gets wrecked.

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:23.030
The party gets canceled.

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:27.320
I wonder how I'll have you make up for all my despair.

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:29.560
That's just my way of celebrating!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.940
But this year we'll do it right! Right?

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:34.730
Yeah...

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:37.940
I want to give you a present, too.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.280
-You have one already?
-What do you want?

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.630
You're asking me that?

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:45.950
I tried, but I couldn't think of anything! Tell me, please!

00:19:54.140 --> 00:19:57.210
A pair accessory.

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:02.220
I said, a pair accessory.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:04.470
-What?
-I said, a pair accessory!

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:07.320
Don't make me keep saying it!

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:10.030
That's surprising.

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:12.410
I don't think so.

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:16.230
That's something any girl would want... I think.

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.990
Got it. Leave it to me!

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:23.990
Okay. I can hardly wait.

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:27.490
I've been defeated.

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:32.500
I'd been trying to split them up for my own purposes.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:37.880
And to think he would save me for her sake.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:42.650
I don't see Persia anywhere.
Where could she be at this hour?

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:45.390
-Hey, Scott!
-Yes!

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:49.740
I'm hungry! Make me hotcakes!

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:51.740
Wear a frilly apron for me!

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:53.490
What?

00:20:55.290 --> 00:21:00.150
But the two of them are, by nature,
cogs that don't interlock.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:06.490
If they force themselves to turn with each other,
they'll break down and come apart.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.130
Curses!

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:10.340
Wow, how lovely!

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:15.180
I wonder what I should do when that happens.

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:27.650
This is my first invitation from Persia!

00:21:27.650 --> 00:21:30.520
I'll make sure it's a success!

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:33.640
Hasuki?

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:37.330
What are you peeking into my room for?

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.080
Inuzuka!

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:40.610
Romio.

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:45.360
Why?

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:57.600
What were you doing out so late?

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:03.460
Airu... Big brother...

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:33.720
Just running and running, so awkward and clumsy

00:22:33.890 --> 00:22:41.730
My passion is so intense that my heart yearns

00:22:41.900 --> 00:22:49.030
Your eyes so honest and earnest

00:22:49.190 --> 00:22:55.660
I want to match the love you have for me

00:22:56.830 --> 00:23:03.880
You don't wait for your dreams to come true, you sprint onward

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:10.220
Pulling me by the hand when I had given up

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:17.470
Your dream suddenly became my dream

00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:19.680
I want to support you

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:27.520
With everything I have

00:23:27.690 --> 00:23:35.620
Until the world can one day change

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:41.030
Scott, these hotcakes you made could use some work.

00:23:41.030 --> 00:23:45.040
-I know! Why don't you do that thing you always do.
-But--

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:45.610
Next time, "Romio and Airu". Now, hurry up!

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:47.790
Romio and Airu
Next time, "Romio and Airu". Now, hurry up!

00:23:47.790 --> 00:23:52.030
Be delicious! Moe moe, kyun!
Romio and Airu
